[{"answer":"It is fun to take a trip to a faraway place.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/33-travel-2019-03-20-09-28-41/1.mp3"},{"answer":"My brother just went to Italy and France.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/33-travel-2019-03-20-09-28-41/2.mp3"},{"answer":"He got on a plane at Toronto Airport.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/33-travel-2019-03-20-09-28-41/3.mp3"},{"answer":"He took a flight to France.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/33-travel-2019-03-20-09-28-41/4-2019-04-29-06-06-28.mp3"},{"answer":"He stayed there for a couple of days.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/33-travel-2019-03-20-09-28-41/5.mp3"},{"answer":"He visited the Eiffel Tower.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/33-travel-2019-03-20-09-28-41/6.mp3"},{"answer":"He was in Paris.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/33-travel-2019-03-20-09-28-41/7.mp3"},{"answer":"He said that he enjoyed the food in France.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/33-travel-2019-03-20-09-28-41/8.mp3"},{"answer":"He then traveled to Italy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/33-travel-2019-03-20-09-28-41/9.mp3"},{"answer":"He saw many towns and villages in Italy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/33-travel-2019-03-20-09-28-41/10.mp3"},{"answer":"He went to Rome and visited many of the tourist attractions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/33-travel-2019-03-20-09-28-41/11.mp3"},{"answer":"In Venice, he saw the canals.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/33-travel-2019-03-20-09-28-41/12.mp3"},{"answer":"He tried to speak Italian, but he is not too good at it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/33-travel-2019-03-20-09-28-41/13.mp3"},{"answer":"He said that the people were very helpful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/33-travel-2019-03-20-09-28-41/14.mp3"},{"answer":"They tried to understand him.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/33-travel-2019-03-20-09-28-41/15.mp3"},{"answer":"He bought souvenirs for us when he was in Italy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/33-travel-2019-03-20-09-28-41/16.mp3"},{"answer":"He ate Italian food.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/33-travel-2019-03-20-09-28-41/17.mp3"},{"answer":"He said that pizza in Italy is quite different from the pizza we eat here in Canada.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/33-travel-2019-03-20-09-28-41/18.mp3"},{"answer":"He saw many streets that were made of cobblestones.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/33-travel-2019-03-20-09-28-41/19.mp3"},{"answer":"He saw many old buildings.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/33-travel-2019-03-20-09-28-41/20.mp3"},{"answer":"A lot of people in Italy travel around on scooters.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/33-travel-2019-03-20-09-28-41/21.mp3"},{"answer":"He stayed at a very nice hotel in Italy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/33-travel-2019-03-20-09-28-41/22.mp3"},{"answer":"He was sorry when it was time to come home.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/33-travel-2019-03-20-09-28-41/23.mp3"},{"answer":"My brother likes to travel.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/33-travel-2019-03-20-09-28-41/24.mp3"},{"answer":"He likes to fly in airplanes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/33-travel-2019-03-20-09-28-41/25.mp3"},{"answer":"The airlines lost his luggage once.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/33-travel-2019-03-20-09-28-41/26.mp3"},{"answer":"He was not too pleased about that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/33-travel-2019-03-20-09-28-41/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Next year, he would like to travel to England.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/33-travel-2019-03-20-09-28-41/28.mp3"}]
